   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Linear inequalities"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "What are linear inequalities?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- Similar to equations but answers take a range of values\n- Linear means there will be no terms other than degree 1\n\n  - no squared terms or higher powers, no fractional or negative powers\n- Number line diagrams are often used"
  },
  {
   "type": "figure",
   "orig_src": "https://cdn.savemyexams.com/uploads/2020/04/2.4.1-Linear-Inequalities-Notes-Diagram-1.png",
